<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>exr-rs third-party licenses</title>
<style>
body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>License texts of the Rust crates compiled into the <code>exr-rs</code> binary.
The notices of the C and C++ projects that exr-rs ports are in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
